# Privacy Policy

**Last updated: October 29, 2026**

## 1. Introduction
We respect your privacy. This Privacy Policy applies to all games developed and published by Roleika and explains how information may be collected and used.

## 2. Information We Collect
Our games do not intentionally collect personal information such as your real name, home address, or phone number.

Some information may be collected automatically through the platform or third-party services, including basic gameplay data, device information, crash reports, and technical information needed to keep the games working.

## 3. Multiplayer and Voice Chat
Some games may include multiplayer or voice chat features. If these features are available, your voice and in-game actions may be transmitted to other players to support communication and gameplay.

Players should avoid sharing personal information with others.

## 4. Third-Party Services
Our games may use third-party services, such as Meta Quest platform services, to provide multiplayer, voice chat, analytics, or technical support.

These services may collect and process information according to their own privacy policies. Roleika does not control the privacy practices of third-party services.

## 5. Children's Privacy
Our games do not intentionally collect personal information from children. If you believe personal information has been collected through one of our games, please contact us so we can review the matter.

## 6. Data Security
We take reasonable steps to protect information associated with our games. However, no online service can guarantee complete security.

## 7. Data Retention and Deletion
Information collected by third-party platforms is handled according to their policies and settings. If you have questions about information associated with our games, you can contact us using the details below.

## 8. Changes to This Policy
We may update this Privacy Policy as our games, services, or features change. Any updates will be published on this page with a revised date.

